==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Vigoroth|47}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*'''Best Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Riolu|90}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

